\ pow_test.fam — the proof of work against tabminer's values (docs/NODE.md,
\ step 4), a program for the OS after arith.fam, poseidon2.fam,
\ difficulty.fam and pow.fam, then pow_vectors.fam: the seed file is
\ /lib/akjv.txt.gz, read whole.

\ rdfile ( path -- addr n )  a whole file of at most 1.25 MiB, in memory
\ (the image's data files cannot seek, so it is read to its end).
: rdfile
0 lit open  dup 0< if "pow_test: no file" puts 0A lit putc then
140000 lit alloc
0 lit begin
	2 lit pick  2 lit pick 2 lit pick +  140000 lit 3 lit pick -  read
	dup 0 lit > while +
repeat drop
rot close drop ;

"/lib/akjv.txt.gz" rdfile dup 13B333 lit <> if "pow_test: the seed file is not 1291059 bytes" puts 0A lit putc then
powinit
